text = "================================================
SUBJECT INTAKE RECORD
DESIGNATION: SUBJECT ZERO
NAME ON FILE: MIRA
STATUS: ACTIVE — CONTAINMENT CHAMBER, SUB-LEVEL 4
================================================

Subject is the only known genetic match capable of
surviving the Catalyst serum. Every other candidate
failed. Subject Zero did not.

RESEARCHER LOG — DR. A. VOSS:

Subject remains lucid. She remembers who she is. She
asks every day if anyone is looking for her.

She has a sibling. That should have been redacted.
It wasn't. I don't think that was an accident.

Sub-Level 4. Containment Chamber 1. She is still
herself. Get her out before the next cycle.
press E to close this file
— A.V.

